WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:04.820
Every family builds a lifetime of belongings,
and the stories that make them matter.

2
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:07.520
HeirDock is a secure place
to know what you own.

3
00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:08.820
Snap a photo.

4
00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:13.590
HeirDock identifies your item, fills in the
details, and helps estimate its value.

5
00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:18.490
Photos, receipts, appraisals, and the story
behind it, all in one place.

6
00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:22.050
Private by default.
Share things on your terms.

7
00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:25.620
HeirDock, protect what matters,
and carry it forward.
